UID:571302a1d9240921@role-civil-litigation-appellate.maine-government-feeds
DTSTAMP:20260909T111935Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260908
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] We the Patriots USA\, Inc. and James Childs\,
  individually and as parent of G.C. v. Pender Makin\, in her official capa
 city as Commissioner of the Maine Department of Education\, and Cari Medd\
 , in her official capacity as Superintendent of Maine School Administrativ
